@startuml ARCH-06
!include ../theme.puml
title ARCH-06 — Lưu trữ media Cloudinary
actor Guest
actor "Booking participant" as Participant
component "Portfolio/UserProfile controllers" as PublicControllers
component "Delivery controllers" as DeliveryControllers
component "ImageValidationUtils" as Validation
component "CloudinaryServiceImpl" as Service
cloud Cloudinary
Guest -> PublicControllers : xem avatar/portfolio
PublicControllers -> Service : public upload/delete
Service -> Validation : MIME + signature + dimensions/size
Service -> Cloudinary : image upload (public)
Cloudinary --> Guest : public delivery URL
Participant -> DeliveryControllers : upload/download/preview
DeliveryControllers -> DeliveryControllers : booking ownership
DeliveryControllers -> Validation
DeliveryControllers -> Service : authenticated upload
Service -> Cloudinary : type=authenticated
Service -> Cloudinary : signed URL, TTL 300s
Cloudinary --> Participant : authorized media response
note bottom of Cloudinary
  Legacy public delivery assets remain a migration risk;
  signed URL wrapping does not make a public asset private.
end note
@enduml

